{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y虽然更容易抓住重点，但部分心理因果被压缩了，例如他究竟有多害怕独自撑下去，以及即使始终等不到亲近的人也愿意好好生活，X交代得更充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【】能让我在听音乐时迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，短句和按音乐时点出现的感受也让我更容易把注意力放在具体的声音、动作和情绪转折上，而不是面对一堆同时出现的词。尤其在怀念、抗拒、孤独、重新站稳这条情绪线上，Y的音乐描述更细腻，也更有前后呼应。不过，X的完整叙述在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么不回头以及最终如何安顿自己方面更有说服力，Y有些地方为了简洁牺牲了心理过程的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f69cf0b1-bbba-44a9-add7-290f5c32cdf5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T220557994950Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:06:37.598656+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "21d1bb330442c579751f78567bc69df5619d03e694306c4b946269154c80f281", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 